::  Five faces then a sealed nest jam-cue — six lines, the named ceiling exactly.
::  Elder mix pair at compose-bind-nest-four-jam-cue (STOA48); this desk seals it.
=/  from=@u32  5
=/  amount=@u32  3
=/  payload=@u32  9
=/  seal=@u32  7
=/  cell-pack=@u32  (jam (mix from amount) (mix payload seal))
=/  right=@u32  (cue cell-pack)
